# The Tests stack's nginx build (tests/Dockerfile.nginx) uses the
# repository root as its context so it can COPY src/user-install.sh. This
# allowlist keeps that context at the single file it needs — node_modules
# alone is 192M, and nothing else here is relevant to what nginx serves.
# The workspace image is unaffected: it builds from src/, governed by
# src/.dockerignore.
*
!src
src/*
!src/user-install.sh
